<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Exact match performance of the re-identification with the instruction-tuned version of the Qwen3 infilling model. Best scores for each level of knowledge are bolded, and best scores for each sub-class and level of knowledge (single order, weighted voting) are underlined. "Direct" and "Quasi" refer to the distinction between direct and quasi-identifiers as marked by annotators in TAB. All results computed over a single run.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S4.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
